      "text": "TRAFFIC ADVISORY \nATCS TESTING\n(Issued in public interest)\n\nTraffic Police, Sri Vijaya Puram, informs all road users that ATCS (Adaptive Traffic Control System) testing will be conducted tomorrow, 07.01.2026, at the following junctions between 11:00 AM and 1:00 PM:\n1.Dollygunj\n2.Minnie Bay\n3.Dairy Farm\n4.Hayat Singh\n5.RBV\n6.Secretariat\n7.IP&T\n8.Murugan Temple\nThe testing is being carried out to assess signal coordination, vehicle flow, and pedestrian safety under live conditions.\nThis exercise is being conducted under the aegis of Sri Vijaya Puram Municipal Council (SVPMC) by Port Blair Smart City Project Ltd.\nImportant Instructions for Motorists\n•Strictly follow traffic signals at all junctions.\n•Left turn will NOT be free at zebra crossings during this period.\n•Vehicles must stop on RED and move only when the signal permits, including left turns.\n•Give priority to pedestrians crossing at zebra crossings as facilitated by the ATCS.\n•Avoid signal jumping, blocking crossings, or abrupt lane changes.\n•Follow instructions of Traffic Police personnel on duty.\nSignal timings may change dynamically during testing,minor delays are expected.\nYour cooperation will help improve a safer, pedestrian-friendly and efficient traffic system for the city.",
